# Requests for the DockerDemo API. Run them from Visual Studio or VS Code (REST Client).
# http://localhost:5192 is the address when running with `dotnet run`; use http://localhost:8080 for the Docker container.
@DockerDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5192

### Detect objects and return the results as JSON
POST {{DockerDemo_HostAddress}}/detect
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=YoloDotNetBoundary

--YoloDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="street.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../test/assets/Media/street.jpg
--YoloDotNetBoundary--

### Detect objects and return the image with the results drawn on it
POST {{DockerDemo_HostAddress}}/detect?download=true
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=YoloDotNetBoundary

--YoloDotNetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="street.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../test/assets/Media/street.jpg
--YoloDotNetBoundary--
